# The generated API types are compared BYTE FOR BYTE by `npm run generate:api:check`.
# openapi-typescript emits CRLF on Windows and LF on Linux, so without this a checkout under
# the common global `core.autocrlf=true` makes that check red on one platform and green on the
# other, for identical content. `mytheus-realtime` lost a whole lint gate to exactly this
# (Plan 3-4 gap 14). `eol=lf` rather than a bare `text=auto` is the load-bearing part:
# `text=auto` alone still honours `core.autocrlf` for the working tree.
src/lib/api/generated/*.ts text eol=lf
